              "summary": "The pgbouncer connection pool in the prod namespace was exhausted, causing worker throughput to drop to 0. Restarting pgbouncer cleared the connection pool. The failed jobs backlog in the jobs database is growing, with 1,388 failed jobs and 47 malformed rows. Further investigation is needed to understand the root cause of the failed jobs.",
